  "description": "VooDoo Canzo Pro Full Suspension Mountain Bike\n\nThe new Pro model takes the Canzo to the next level. With the improved suspension, groupset, wheels, and tyres, it's a trail-taming powerhouse finished in a head-turning purple flip paint. Equipped with a 140mm Pike fork and Deluxe Select + shock, a 65° head angle, a long top tube, and a low stand over, this bike is both plush and planted. Together with wide WTB 29er wheels and Maxxis tyres, it's ready to get wild in the wilderness. Built with durability and performance in mind, the Canzo Pro is your ticket to endless biking adventures, whether you're hitting the bike park or exploring local trails.\n\nExperience The ALL NEW VooDoo Canzo Pro Full Suspension Mountain Bike that combines advanced engineering with rugged durability, empowering you to tackle the toughest trails and elevate your riding adventures to new heights.",
